Xontra

Netplay fork of Team-Resurgent/Contra-NES-X.
Original Xbox port of Contra (Konami, NES, 1988).

The project's own source, tools, build scripts, server, and platform definitions
are provided under the MIT License in LICENSE. Game ROMs, cartridge assets, SDK
libraries, and third-party source distributions are not included.

External build dependencies retain their own terms:

  vermiceli/nes-contra-us
  https://github.com/vermiceli/nes-contra-us
  Annotated Contra (US) disassembly, building on Trax's disassembly. setup.py
  fetches the pinned DECOMP_REV into extern/nes-contra-us for optional local
  assembly. Cartridge graphics and music are extracted from baserom.nes.

  cc65 2.19
  https://github.com/cc65/cc65
  Assembler and linker for the disassembly build. setup.py fetches CC65_REV
  into extern/cc65 and builds the tools locally. Licensed under its own
  zlib-style terms.

Netplay transport and frame-history design reference:
  Undead Neighbor Eaters / ZAMN netplay. Contra implements a separate game
  protocol, deterministic state history, and matchmaking/relay service.

The CPU test harness supports Klaus Dormann's 6502 functional test. Its test
binary is not included. The NES palette is generated by tools/palette.py.

Built with RXDK: https://github.com/Team-Resurgent

